{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Tissa (1st)","html":"<article id='thag1.39'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 1.39 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 1.39 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Catutthavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Four </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Tissattheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Tissa (1st) </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Sattiyā viya omaṭṭho, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Like they’re struck by a sword, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>ḍayhamānova matthake; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>like their head was on fire, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Kāmarāgappahānāya, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>a mendicant should wander mindful </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>sato bhikkhu paribbaje”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>to give up sensual desire. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Tisso thero …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
